exclusions.description:
Exclusions common to all cover :  claims arising from the 
following are not covered : wilful or intentional deceit or gross negligence on the 
part of the insured person(s) or the beneficiary ;

the insured person being in a state of drunkenness or 
inebriation, their taking of hallucinogenic products, 
narcotics or drugs and an abusive use of medication ;
